00:20:49,666 --> 00:20:52,733
我是从小时候一直喝到现在
wǒ shì cóng xiǎoshíhòu yìzhí hē dào xiànzài
I’ve been drinking it since I was a kid until now

512
00:20:52,733 --> 00:20:54,200
我现在每次去超市
wǒ xiànzài měi cì qù chāoshì
Now, every time I go to the supermarket

513
00:20:54,200 --> 00:20:57,866
我还是会买4瓶AD钙奶
wǒ háishì huì mǎi sì píng AD gàinǎi
I still buy four bottles of AD calcium milk

514
00:20:57,866 --> 00:20:59,133
然后回来喝
ránhòu huílái hē
And drink them at home

515
00:21:00,066 --> 00:21:01,833
对现在我也会喝
duì xiànzài wǒ yě huì hē
Yeah, I still drink it now too

516
00:21:01,833 --> 00:21:03,233
可是小的时候
kěshì xiǎo de shíhòu
But when I was little

517
00:21:03,233 --> 00:21:04,666
我的爷爷奶奶
wǒ de yéye nǎinai
My grandparents

518
00:21:04,666 --> 00:21:07,833
他们给我买很多很多的AD钙奶
tāmen gěi wǒ mǎi hěn duō hěn duō de AD gàinǎi
They bought me a lot of AD calcium milk

519
00:21:07,866 --> 00:21:11,400
我差不多一天要喝五六瓶AD钙奶
wǒ chàbuduō yì tiān yào hē wǔ liù píng AD gàinǎi
I drank about five or six bottles a day

520
00:21:11,433 --> 00:21:14,300
所以我家有非常多的空瓶子
suǒyǐ wǒ jiā yǒu fēicháng duō de kōng píngzi
So my home had a lot of empty bottles

521
00:21:14,500 --> 00:21:18,066
然后有人来收这种破的瓶子呀
ránhòu yǒu rén lái shōu zhè zhǒng pò de píngzi ya
Then people came to collect broken bottles like these

522
00:21:18,066 --> 00:21:20,066
或者是空的一些东西呀
huòzhě shì kōng de yìxiē dōngxi ya
Or some empty items

523
00:21:20,066 --> 00:21:21,400
他们就会说
tāmen jiù huì shuō
They would say

524
00:21:21,400 --> 00:21:23,466
你家有这个瓶子可以卖吗
nǐ jiā yǒu zhè ge píngzi kěyǐ mài ma
Do you have this kind of bottle to sell?

525
00:21:23,466 --> 00:21:24,933
我们就全都卖给他
wǒmen jiù quándōu mài gěi tā
We would sell them all to him

526
00:21:24,933 --> 00:21:28,866
我们要问一下Weixuan
wǒmen yào wèn yíxià Weixuan
Let’s ask Weixuan something

527
00:21:28,900 --> 00:21:33,466
如果说大家知道你是内蒙古人
rúguǒ shuō dàjiā zhīdào nǐ shì Nèiměnggǔ rén
If people know you're from Inner Mongolia

528
00:21:33,466 --> 00:21:35,866
一般会问你什么样的问题
yìbān huì wèn nǐ shénmeyàng de wèntí
What kind of questions do they usually ask you?

529
00:21:36,033 --> 00:21:38,033
一般会问我很多很多问题
yìbān huì wèn wǒ hěn duō hěn duō wèntí
They usually ask me lots of questions

530
00:21:38,300 --> 00:21:42,266
比如你会骑马吗
bǐrú nǐ huì qímǎ ma
Like, “Can you ride a horse?”

531
00:21:42,733 --> 00:21:46,833
你家住在帐篷里吗
nǐ jiā zhù zài zhàngpeng lǐ ma
“Does your family live in a tent?”

532
00:21:47,033 --> 00:21:51,466
啊你们要学射箭吗
a nǐmen yào xué shèjiàn ma
“Oh, do you guys learn archery?”

533
00:21:51,700 --> 00:21:55,700
还有你会说蒙语吗
hái yǒu nǐ huì shuō Méngyǔ ma
“Do you speak Mongolian?”

534
00:21:55,800 --> 00:21:58,933
你会跳蒙族舞吗
nǐ huì tiào Méngzú wǔ ma
“Can you dance Mongolian dances?”

535
00:21:59,033 --> 00:22:01,466
每一次有新的朋友
měi yí cì yǒu xīn de péngyǒu
Every time I meet new friends

536
00:22:01,466 --> 00:22:03,233
我都要给他们解释一遍
wǒ dōu yào gěi tāmen jiěshì yíbiàn
I have to explain to them all over again

537
00:22:03,900 --> 00:22:07,033
你们小时候会学习蒙语吗
nǐmen xiǎoshíhòu huì xuéxí Méngyǔ ma
Did you learn Mongolian when you were kids?

538
00:22:07,033 --> 00:22:08,533
这个我很想问
zhège wǒ hěn xiǎng wèn
I really want to ask this

539
00:22:09,533 --> 00:22:11,633
不会我们不会学蒙语
bù huì wǒmen bù huì xué Méngyǔ
No, we didn’t learn Mongolian

540
00:22:11,833 --> 00:22:14,666
但是如果是蒙古族的学校
dànshì rúguǒ shì Ménggǔzú de xuéxiào
But if it's a Mongolian ethnic school

541
00:22:14,700 --> 00:22:16,266
他们会说蒙语
tāmen huì shuō Méngyǔ
Then they do speak Mongolian

542
00:22:16,533 --> 00:22:18,833
Weixuan那蒙古族的学生
Weixuan nà Ménggǔzú de xuéshēng
Weixuan, so do Mongolian students

543
00:22:18,833 --> 00:22:21,633
他们只能去蒙古族的学校吗
tāmen zhǐ néng qù Ménggǔzú de xuéxiào ma
Only go to Mongolian schools?

544
00:22:21,933 --> 00:22:23,200
不不不
bù bù bù
No, no, no

545
00:22:23,200 --> 00:22:24,266
他们可以选
tāmen kěyǐ xuǎn
They can choose

546
00:22:24,266 --> 00:22:26,100
他们可以去蒙古族的学校
tāmen kěyǐ qù Ménggǔzú de xuéxiào
They can go to a Mongolian school

547
00:22:26,100 --> 00:22:27,300
也可以去
yě kěyǐ qù
Or they can go to

548
00:22:27,300 --> 00:22:30,033
汉族的学校都可以
Hànzú de xuéxiào dōu kěyǐ
A Han Chinese school—both are okay

549
00:22:30,266 --> 00:22:32,233
或者其他民族的学校
huòzhě qítā mínzú de xuéxiào
Or a school of another ethnicity

550
00:22:32,433 --> 00:22:35,266
比如我的高中就是一个
bǐrú wǒ de gāozhōng jiù shì yí gè
For example, my high school was

551
00:22:35,900 --> 00:22:37,200
回族的学校
Huízú de xuéxiào
A Hui (Muslim ethnic group) school

552
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:39,600
所以在你的学校的餐厅
suǒyǐ zài nǐ de xuéxiào de cāntīng
So in your school cafeteria

553
00:22:39,800 --> 00:22:41,700
食堂没有猪肉对不对
shítáng méiyǒu zhūròu duì bù duì
There was no pork, right?

554
00:22:41,733 --> 00:22:43,500
没有没有猪肉
méiyǒu méiyǒu zhūròu
No, no pork at all

555
00:22:43,633 --> 00:22:46,700
然后我们学校的食堂旁边
ránhòu wǒmen xuéxiào de shítáng pángbiān
And next to our school cafeteria

556
00:22:46,700 --> 00:22:49,000
有个很大很大的超市
yǒu gè hěn dà hěn dà de chāoshì
There was a very big supermarket

557
00:22:49,133 --> 00:22:51,133
里边所有的东西
lǐbiān suǒyǒu de dōngxi
Everything inside

558
00:22:51,200 --> 00:22:53,600
都是不可以和猪有关的
dōu shì bù kěyǐ hé zhū yǒuguān de
Couldn’t contain anything related to pork

559
00:22:53,700 --> 00:22:55,700
包括吃的口香糖
bāokuò chī de kǒuxiāngtáng
Including chewing gum

560
00:22:55,900 --> 00:22:57,700
它里面有一个成分
tā lǐmiàn yǒu yí gè chéngfèn
If it had one ingredient inside

561
00:22:57,700 --> 00:22:59,666
就可能要加一点猪油
jiù kěnéng yào jiā yìdiǎn zhūyóu
That might include a bit of pork fat

562
00:22:59,666 --> 00:23:00,866
然后也不可以
ránhòu yě bù kěyǐ
Then it wasn’t allowed either

563
00:23:01,033 --> 00:23:04,266
所以所有的东西都是专门做的
suǒyǐ suǒyǒu de dōngxi dōu shì zhuānmén zuò de
So everything was specially made

564
00:23:04,300 --> 00:23:06,800
然后很多人对内蒙古人的印象
ránhòu hěn duō rén duì Nèiměnggǔ rén de yìnxiàng
And many people’s impression of Inner Mongolians

565
00:23:06,800 --> 00:23:09,900
就是和东北人很像
jiùshì hé Dōngběi rén hěn xiàng
Is that they're very similar to Northeasterners

566
00:23:10,000 --> 00:23:10,533
就是觉得
jiùshì juéde
They think

567
00:23:10,533 --> 00:23:13,100
内蒙古人也可以喝很多很多的酒
Nèiměnggǔ rén yě kěyǐ hē hěn duō hěn duō de jiǔ
Inner Mongolians can also drink a lot of alcohol

568
00:23:13,633 --> 00:23:15,033
其实是真的
qíshí shì zhēn de
Actually, it’s true

569
00:23:15,033 --> 00:23:19,833
就是如果两个内蒙的人坐在一起
jiùshì rúguǒ liǎng gè Nèiměng de rén zuò zài yìqǐ
Like, if two Inner Mongolians sit together

570
00:23:19,833 --> 00:23:21,800
如果即使只有他们两个人
rúguǒ jíshǐ zhǐ yǒu tāmen liǎng gè rén
Even if it’s just the two of them

571
00:23:21,800 --> 00:23:23,100
他们也会喝酒
tāmen yě huì hējiǔ
They will still drink alcohol

572
00:23:23,433 --> 00:23:25,033
而且会喝很多酒
érqiě huì hē hěn duō jiǔ
And they’ll drink a lot

573
00:23:25,666 --> 00:23:27,733
然后如果是很多人
ránhòu rúguǒ shì hěn duō rén
And if there are many people

574
00:23:27,733 --> 00:23:29,266
大家聚在一起
dàjiā jù zài yìqǐ
Everyone gathers together

575
00:23:29,266 --> 00:23:30,100
一起吃饭
yìqǐ chīfàn
Eat together

576
00:23:30,100 --> 00:23:31,533
我们还会唱歌
wǒmen hái huì chànggē
We also sing songs

577
00:23:31,633 --> 00:23:33,533
我们会唱祝酒歌
wǒmen huì chàng zhùjiǔgē
We sing toasting songs

578
00:23:33,533 --> 00:23:35,266
祝酒歌就是我唱这首歌
zhùjiǔgē jiùshì wǒ chàng zhè shǒu gē
A toasting song means I sing this song

579
00:23:35,266 --> 00:23:37,033
我唱完然后你喝酒
wǒ chàng wán ránhòu nǐ hējiǔ
After I sing, then you drink

580
00:23:37,666 --> 00:23:40,200
会唱很多很多的祝酒歌
huì chàng hěn duō hěn duō de zhùjiǔgē
There are many, many toasting songs

581
00:23:40,600 --> 00:23:42,700
但是你要看
dànshì nǐ yào kàn
But you need to see

582
00:23:42,700 --> 00:23:46,100
比如说第一次喝酒是祝酒歌1
bǐrú shuō dì yī cì hējiǔ shì zhùjiǔgē yī
For example, the first round is Toast Song 1

583
00:23:46,233 --> 00:23:48,866
然后第二次喝酒是祝酒歌2
ránhòu dì èr cì hējiǔ shì zhùjiǔgē èr
Then the second round is Toast Song 2

584
00:23:49,133 --> 00:23:51,033
所以有的人会说
suǒyǐ yǒu de rén huì shuō
So some people will say

585
00:23:51,133 --> 00:23:53,733
这首祝酒歌我没有听过
zhè shǒu zhùjiǔgē wǒ méiyǒu tīng guò
I've never heard this toasting song

586
00:23:53,733 --> 00:23:56,000
这个真的是祝酒歌吗
zhè ge zhēn de shì zhùjiǔgē ma
Is this really a toasting song?

587
00:23:56,000 --> 00:23:58,266
然后我的朋友说是
ránhòu wǒ de péngyǒu shuō shì
And my friend says yes

588
00:23:58,300 --> 00:24:00,500
只不过还没有到这首歌的时候
zhǐ bùguò hái méiyǒu dào zhè shǒu gē de shíhòu
It’s just that we hadn’t gotten to this one yet

589
00:24:00,500 --> 00:24:01,633
你已经喝醉了
nǐ yǐjīng hē zuì le
You were already drunk

590
00:24:01,633 --> 00:24:02,833
你什么都不知道了
nǐ shénme dōu bù zhīdào le
You didn’t know anything by then

591
00:24:02,833 --> 00:24:04,000
所以你不知道
suǒyǐ nǐ bù zhīdào
So you didn’t realize

592
00:24:04,000 --> 00:24:07,766
这个也是祝酒歌
zhè ge yě shì zhùjiǔgē
This was also a toasting song

593
00:24:07,766 --> 00:24:09,400
哈哈哈
hā hā hā
Hahaha

594
00:24:09,400 --> 00:24:10,033
好吧
hǎo ba
Alright then

595
00:24:10,033 --> 00:24:11,400
喝很多很多酒
hē hěn duō hěn duō jiǔ
Drink a lot of alcohol

596
00:24:12,033 --> 00:24:15,233
然后我也不喜欢喝酒
ránhòu wǒ yě bù xǐhuān hējiǔ
And I also don’t like drinking alcohol

597
00:24:15,600 --> 00:24:18,500
但是我酒精不过敏
dànshì wǒ jiǔjīng bù guòmǐn
But I'm not allergic to alcohol

598
00:24:19,533 --> 00:24:21,433
所以我没有办法
suǒyǐ wǒ méiyǒu bànfǎ
So I have no excuse

599
00:24:21,433 --> 00:24:24,066
我每次就会喝两杯酒
wǒ měi cì jiù huì hē liǎng bēi jiǔ
Every time, I just drink two glasses

600
00:24:25,900 --> 00:24:27,900
我说啊我不行了我喝不了了
wǒ shuō a wǒ bùxíng le wǒ hē bù liǎo le
I say, ah I can’t, I can’t drink anymore

601
00:24:27,900 --> 00:24:28,833
就不喝了
jiù bù hē le
Then I stop drinking

602
00:24:28,833 --> 00:24:29,933
那Fanfan呢
nà Fanfan ne
What about you, Fanfan?

603
00:24:29,933 --> 00:24:31,533
你作为东北人
nǐ zuòwéi Dōngběi rén
As a Northeasterner

604
00:24:31,600 --> 00:24:34,800
大家一般会问你什么样的问题
dàjiā yìbān huì wèn nǐ shénme yàng de wèntí
What kind of questions do people usually ask you?

605
00:24:34,800 --> 00:24:37,233
东北人真的很能喝酒吗
Dōngběi rén zhēn de hěn néng hējiǔ ma
Are Northeasterners really good at drinking?

606
00:24:37,333 --> 00:24:41,066
东北的菜那个量真的很大吗
Dōngběi de cài nà ge liàng zhēn de hěn dà ma
Are Northeastern dishes really that large in portion?

607
00:24:41,200 --> 00:24:44,233
然后东北人的普通话怎么样
ránhòu Dōngběi rén de pǔtōnghuà zěnme yàng
And how is Northeasterners’ Mandarin?

608
00:24:44,333 --> 00:24:46,833
东北人的普通话好吗
Dōngběi rén de pǔtōnghuà hǎo ma
Do Northeasterners speak good Mandarin?

609
00:24:46,900 --> 00:24:50,000
东北人真的是很虎吗
Dōngběi rén zhēn de shì hěn hǔ ma
Are Northeasterners really "hǔ" (silly/foolish/bold)?

610
00:24:50,066 --> 00:24:51,500
就是你们可能不知道
jiùshì nǐmen kěnéng bù zhīdào
You might not know

611
00:24:51,500 --> 00:24:52,700
虎这个字
hǔ zhè ge zì
the word "hǔ"

612
00:24:53,066 --> 00:24:55,600
我真的很难解释虎这个字
wǒ zhēn de hěn nán jiěshì hǔ zhè ge zì
It's really hard for me to explain the word “hǔ”

613
00:24:55,800 --> 00:24:57,800
就是他是有一点
jiùshì tā shì yǒu yìdiǎn
It’s kind of like

614
00:24:57,800 --> 00:24:58,733
还不是笨
hái bù shì bèn
Not exactly stupid

615
00:24:58,733 --> 00:24:59,866
也不是傻
yě bù shì shǎ
Not exactly foolish either

616
00:24:59,933 --> 00:25:02,433
但是好像在这个中间的那种感觉
dànshì hǎoxiàng zài zhè ge zhōngjiān de nà zhǒng gǎnjué
But kind of something in between

617
00:25:02,433 --> 00:25:03,433
有一点虎
yǒu yìdiǎn hǔ
A bit “hǔ”

618
00:25:05,266 --> 00:25:06,466
比如说有一个人
bǐrú shuō yǒu yí gè rén
For example, if someone

619
00:25:06,466 --> 00:25:10,200
他可能就是我会一直看着你
tā kěnéng jiùshì wǒ huì yìzhí kàn zhe nǐ
Just keeps staring at you

620
00:25:10,266 --> 00:25:12,633
然后他就会用东北话说
ránhòu tā jiù huì yòng Dōngběi huà shuō
Then he’ll say in Northeastern dialect

621
00:25:13,466 --> 00:25:14,700
你瞅我干啥
nǐ chǒu wǒ gàn shá
What are you looking at?

622
00:25:14,900 --> 00:25:16,466
另外一个人就会说
lìngwài yí gè rén jiù huì shuō
The other person will reply

623
00:25:16,666 --> 00:25:17,700
我瞅你咋地
wǒ chǒu nǐ zǎ dì
I’m looking, so what?

624
00:25:17,700 --> 00:25:19,666
哈哈哈
hā hā hā
Hahaha

625
00:25:19,666 --> 00:25:21,066
可能可能
kěnéng kěnéng
Maybe, maybe

626
00:25:21,100 --> 00:25:22,066
哈哈哈
hā hā hā
Hahaha

627
00:25:22,066 --> 00:25:23,233
再有两句话
zài yǒu liǎng jù huà
A couple more lines later

628
00:25:23,233 --> 00:25:25,066
两个人就要打起来
liǎng gè rén jiù yào dǎ qǐlái
The two people might start fighting

629
00:25:26,233 --> 00:25:31,000
所以大家的刻板印象是东北人很虎
suǒyǐ dàjiā de kèbǎn yìnxiàng shì Dōngběi rén hěn hǔ
So the stereotype is that Northeasterners are “hǔ”

630
00:25:31,000 --> 00:25:32,500
脾气不太好
píqi bù tài hǎo
They have a bad temper

631
00:25:33,033 --> 00:25:35,700
然后东北人的嗓门很大
ránhòu Dōngběi rén de sǎngmén hěn dà
And they speak very loudly

632
00:25:35,800 --> 00:25:39,100
嗓门就是他说话的声音很大
sǎngmén jiùshì tā shuōhuà de shēngyīn hěn dà
"Sǎngmén" means they have a loud voice when talking

633
00:25:39,433 --> 00:25:42,833
好像如果你在餐厅吃饭的时候
hǎoxiàng rúguǒ nǐ zài cāntīng chīfàn de shíhòu
Like if you’re eating in a restaurant

634
00:25:42,833 --> 00:25:45,333
如果有一桌是东北人在喝酒
rúguǒ yǒu yì zhuō shì Dōngběi rén zài hējiǔ
And there's a table of Northeasterners drinking

635
00:25:45,333 --> 00:25:49,333
你就会只能听到他们那桌在说话
nǐ jiù huì zhǐ néng tīng dào tāmen nà zhuō zài shuōhuà
You’ll only be able to hear their table talking

636
00:25:49,333 --> 00:25:51,133
好像是在打架一样
hǎoxiàng shì zài dǎjià yíyàng
It sounds like they're fighting.

637
00:25:51,133 --> 00:25:53,466
声音是非常非常大的
shēngyīn shì fēicháng fēicháng dà de
Their voices are really, really loud.

638
00:25:53,666 --> 00:25:55,400
哈哈哈
hā hā hā
Hahaha

639
00:25:56,200 --> 00:25:57,033
是的
shì de
Yes.

640
00:25:57,100 --> 00:26:00,433
我印象中的东北人都超级可爱
wǒ yìnxiàng zhōng de Dōngběi rén dōu chāojí kě'ài
In my impression, Northeasterners are all super cute.

641
00:26:00,600 --> 00:26:02,000
超级好玩
chāojí hǎowán
And super fun.

642
00:26:02,033 --> 00:26:05,600
我觉得今天我们给大家说了很多
wǒ juéde jīntiān wǒmen gěi dàjiā shuō le hěn duō
I think today we’ve shared a lot with everyone

643
00:26:05,600 --> 00:26:08,533
关于我们来自的地方
guānyú wǒmen láizì de dìfāng
about the places we come from

644
00:26:08,533 --> 00:26:12,200
大家的刻板印象
dàjiā de kèbǎn yìnxiàng
and the stereotypes people have.

645
00:26:12,200 --> 00:26:13,800
那大家听到这里
nà dàjiā tīng dào zhèlǐ
So after listening to this,

646
00:26:13,800 --> 00:26:16,433
你们觉得这些地方有意思吗
nǐmen juéde zhèxiē dìfāng yǒuyìsi ma
Do you think these places sound interesting?

647
00:26:16,633 --> 00:26:19,900
你们想不想去这些地方旅游
nǐmen xiǎng bù xiǎng qù zhèxiē dìfāng lǚyóu
Would you like to travel to these places?

648
00:26:20,066 --> 00:26:23,000
或者你们认不认识这里的地方呢
huòzhě nǐmen rèn bù rènshì zhèlǐ de dìfāng ne
Or are you already familiar with these places?

649
00:26:23,000 --> 00:26:26,033
大家可以留言告诉我们
dàjiā kěyǐ liúyán gàosù wǒmen
Feel free to leave a comment and let us know.

650
00:26:26,033 --> 00:26:28,000
OK今天说到这里
OK jīntiān shuō dào zhèlǐ
Okay, that’s it for today.

651
00:26:28,000 --> 00:26:29,300
大家下次见
dàjiā xiàcì jiàn
See you all next time.

652
00:26:29,300 --> 00:26:31,066
好拜拜再见
hǎo bàibài zàijiàn
Alright, bye-bye, see you!

653
00:26:31,500 --> 00:26:33,433
拜拜拜拜
bàibài bàibài
Bye-bye, bye-bye!

